## Low — process

### V23-16 — v0.22 tag still points at broken code · OBSERVED

Carried forward from v0.22 and still true. `v0.22.0` is at `a5d84956f`, which has the ZK
proving keys deleted and proving silently disabled. `v0.22.1` (`b2539661b`) restores them but
predates the entire v0.22 remediation, now merged as `d6b6b9dda`.

> **Fix**: tag `main`. Nothing should be released from either existing v0.22 tag.

